        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SB35U32D 3-1/2\" Stainless Steel Spring Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 3-1/2 inch stainless steel spring barrel bolt is easy to install and packaged with stainless steel mounting screws. It can be surface mounted horizontally or vertically. The spring loaded lever insures the slide bolt stays in either the locked or unlocked position that you put it.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nBecause it is constructed of all 304 grade stainless steel, it is great for oudoor use and in harsh conditions (high corrosion environments). It has a long lasting, beautiful satin stainless steel finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-SB35U32D_size.gif?v=1704354558\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SB35U32D 3-1/2 Inch Stainless Steel Spring Bolt Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana SB35U32D 3-1/2\" Stainless Steel Spring Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Housing Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Maximum Projection (including knob): 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Housing Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SB35U32D.pdf?v=1691095375\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SB35U32DDimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
